From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] SpiderMonkey: JIT code through the *FromApp allocators, ARM32
 Windows

Executable memory comes from VirtualAllocFromApp/VirtualProtectFromApp,
which the codeGeneration capability allows; plus the ARM32 Windows bits the
JIT and Wasm lack (division helpers, signal handling, atomics).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
